  "body": "## Summary\n\n```text\npkgs/atlas-search/\n├── fixtures/dns-search-corpus.sql     # isolated DNS source document\n├── fixtures/dns-search-spec.json      # fixed toy query/document vectors\n└── crates/atlas-core/tests/parity.rs  # vector retrieval assertion\n```\n\nAdds an explicit `infra/dns/dns_config.yaml` retrieval fixture. The production Atlas corpus is external and is a personal-conversation corpus, not a code-document manifest; this PR does not mutate it or claim production ingestion. Existing code#6025 (queued task 13656) tracks first-pass ingestion of repository documents. Issue #2469 remains open for that production follow-up; this PR references rather than auto-closes it.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** no Atlas fixture named the DNS source or asserted retrieval of its MX record.\n  **After:** the fixture query `Which MX host handles mail for 01b.us?` returns `infra/dns/dns_config.yaml` with `monday.mxrouting.net` through the vector-search path.\n- `cargo test --manifest-path pkgs/atlas-search/Cargo.toml -p atlas-core` — 42 unit, 6 parity, 11 shard, and 6 stage tests passed.\n- `rustfmt --check --edition 2024 pkgs/atlas-search/crates/atlas-core/tests/parity.rs` and `git diff --check` pass. Workspace `cargo fmt --all --check` still reports pre-existing formatting drift in untouched `crates/atlas-embed/tests/gate_a.rs`.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way — test-fixture-only change, revertible without production data changes.\n\n**Blast Radius:** low — isolated `atlas-core` parity fixture.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796761161&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7802&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7802&signature=a444ba9ad6012f97483cc9d099ad4505881ac22851c481574227be41954e03eb\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7802?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
